WEBVTT

00:09.103 --> 00:10.517
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.517 --> 00:12.310
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.310 --> 00:13.758
- I CAN'’T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.758 --> 00:15.586
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.586 --> 00:18.620
- ♪ OHH... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:18.620 --> 00:20.827
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.827 --> 00:22.862
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.862 --> 00:24.896
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.896 --> 00:26.586
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.586 --> 00:28.896
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.896 --> 00:30.413
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.413 --> 00:32.896
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.896 --> 00:34.793
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.793 --> 00:36.827
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:36.827 --> 00:38.758
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.758 --> 00:40.724
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.724 --> 00:41.965
- ♪ SPONGEBOB ♪
- ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:41.965 --> 00:44.275
♪ SQUAREPANTS! ♪
♪ 方裤！ ♪

00:44.275 --> 00:46.724
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.724 --> 00:49.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.034 --> 00:50.448
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.068 --> 00:56.068
[nautical themed music]
【航海主题音乐】

00:56.068 --> 01:04.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:07.379 --> 01:08.655
- OOH.
-哦。

01:08.655 --> 01:10.310
DELICIOUS.
可口的。

01:11.551 --> 01:13.724
pop!
流行音乐！

01:13.724 --> 01:14.965
squish!
压扁！

01:14.965 --> 01:16.206
pop!
流行音乐！

01:16.206 --> 01:17.620
squish! squish! squish!
压扁！压扁！压扁！

01:17.620 --> 01:19.310
pop! pop! pop!
流行音乐！流行音乐！流行音乐！

01:19.310 --> 01:22.206
[multiple squishing sounds]
[多次挤压声]

01:23.689 --> 01:26.103
[multiple popping sounds]
[多次爆裂声]

01:32.344 --> 01:34.068
quack!
嘎嘎！

01:34.068 --> 01:37.000
[various smooshing sounds]
[各种噼啪声]

01:39.896 --> 01:41.517
TOP OF THE MORNIN'’ TO YOU!
祝您早安！

01:41.517 --> 01:43.000
[laughs]
[笑]

01:46.275 --> 01:47.689
- [meows]
- [喵]

01:50.724 --> 01:52.689
KRUSTY KRAB, SPONGEBOB SPEAKING.
蟹堡王，海绵宝宝说话。

01:52.689 --> 01:54.793
[laughs]
[笑]

01:54.793 --> 01:56.448
ring! ring!
戒指！戒指！

01:56.448 --> 01:59.448
GARY, IS THAT YOU?
加里，是你吗？

01:59.448 --> 02:00.724
GARY, I KNOW YOU'’RE THERE.
加里，我知道你在那里。

02:00.724 --> 02:02.310
I CAN HEAR YOU BREATHING.
我能听到你的呼吸声。

02:09.586 --> 02:10.517
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:11.758 --> 02:14.137
OOH!
哦！

02:20.827 --> 02:22.931
MR. KRABS!
先生。螃蟹！

02:22.931 --> 02:25.413
THIS WEINER TASTES
JUST LIKE A KRABBY PATTY.
这个威纳口味
就像蟹肉饼一样。

02:25.413 --> 02:27.241
MAYBE WE CAN ADD THEM
TO THE MENU.
也许我们可以添加它们
到菜单。

02:27.241 --> 02:28.482
- I'’M NOT IMPRESSED.
- 我不印象深刻。

02:28.482 --> 02:30.137
- I MADE IT
WITH LEFTOVER INGREDIENTS.
- 我做到了
与剩余的成分。

02:30.137 --> 02:31.896
- NOW I'’M IMPRESSED.
- 现在我印象深刻。

02:36.206 --> 02:39.103
- HMM, I COULD'’VE SWORN
THAT SIGN SAID "OPEN."
- 嗯，我可以发誓
那个标志写着“开放”。

02:40.551 --> 02:42.896
[sighs dramatically]
[戏剧性地叹气]

02:42.896 --> 02:47.517
- ONCE IN A WHILE I NEED TO
BREATHE IN AND NOT SMELL GREASE
- 偶尔我需要
吸气，不要闻到油脂味

02:47.517 --> 02:51.413
OR THE STENCH
OF MY MISERABLY FAILED LIFE.
或者恶臭
我悲惨失败的一生。

02:52.931 --> 02:54.103
TALKING TO MYSELF...
自言自语...

02:54.103 --> 02:55.000
AGAIN.
再次。

02:56.275 --> 03:01.310
- AND THEN I JUST COOK IT
LIKE THIS...
- 然后我就煮它
像这样...

03:01.310 --> 03:02.413
- GO ON.
- 继续。

03:02.413 --> 03:05.206
- MY, WHAT AN INTERESTING SHAPE.
- 天啊，多么有趣的形状啊。

03:05.206 --> 03:06.551
ARE THOSE FOR SALE?
那些在卖吗？

03:06.551 --> 03:07.586
- WHY?
- 为什么？

03:07.586 --> 03:08.551
WOULD YOU LIKE TO BUY ONE?
您想买一个吗？

03:08.551 --> 03:09.724
- WELL...
- 出色地...

03:09.724 --> 03:11.689
THAT WOULD DEPEND
ON THE PRICE.
这要看情况
关于价格。

03:11.689 --> 03:13.689
- WOULD YOU PAY THE SAME
AS WHAT A KRABBY PATTY COSTS?
- 你愿意付同样的钱吗
甲蟹肉饼的价格是多少？

03:13.689 --> 03:15.034
- HMM.
- 唔。

03:15.034 --> 03:16.724
SURE, I SUPPOSE SO.
当然，我想是这样。

03:16.724 --> 03:18.620
- HOW ABOUT DOUBLE?
- 双倍怎么样？

03:18.620 --> 03:20.448
- NOW YOU'’RE TALKING.
- 现在你开始说话了。

03:20.448 --> 03:22.310
- KRABBY PATTIES AGAIN?
- 又是蟹肉饼？

03:22.310 --> 03:23.724
[sighs]
[叹气]

03:23.724 --> 03:27.137
IF ONLY THERE WERE
SOMETHING ELSE.
如果有的话
还有别的事。

03:27.137 --> 03:28.655
HEY, WHAT YOU GOT THERE, FRANK?
嘿，弗兰克，你得到了什么？

03:28.655 --> 03:29.965
- IT'’S NEW.
- 这是新的。

03:29.965 --> 03:31.724
TASTES JUST LIKE
A KRABBY PATTY,
味道就像
蟹肉饼，

03:31.724 --> 03:34.344
BUT IT'’S SHAPED LIKE A WEINER.
但它的形状像威纳啤酒。

03:34.344 --> 03:37.310
[all talking at once]
[大家同时说话]

03:37.310 --> 03:40.206
- HEY, I'’D LIKE TO
REQUEST A WEINER.
- 嘿，我愿意
请求威纳。

03:40.206 --> 03:41.620
- ME TOO.
- ME TOO.
- 我也是。
- 我也是。

03:41.620 --> 03:44.827
all: WIENERS! WIENERS! WIENERS!
所有人：维也纳香肠！香肠！香肠！

03:44.827 --> 03:46.689
- [wheezing]
- [喘息]

03:46.689 --> 03:49.689
[chalk squeaking]
[粉笔吱吱作响]

03:49.689 --> 03:51.344
- SQUIDWARD, WHAT'’S THAT NOISE?
- 章鱼哥，那是什么声音？

03:51.344 --> 03:52.758
- EXCRUCIATING.
- 令人难以忍受。

03:52.758 --> 03:54.586
- UP HERE, BOY;
TAKE A LOOK.
- 男孩，在这儿；
看一下。

03:55.931 --> 03:57.310
- I CAN'’T READ IT FROM HERE,
MR. KRABS.
- 我无法从这里阅读它，
先生。螃蟹。

03:57.310 --> 03:58.620
WHAT'’S IT SAY?
它说什么？

03:58.620 --> 04:02.655
- IT SAYS,
"KRUSTY DOGS ONLY $3.99
- 它说，
“Krusty Dogs 仅售 3.99 美元

04:02.655 --> 04:05.448
OR $4.99 WITH CHEESE."
或加奶酪 4.99 美元。”

04:05.448 --> 04:06.620
- $4.99?
- 4.99 美元？

04:06.620 --> 04:08.344
THAT'’S HIGHWAY ROBBERY.
这就是高速公路抢劫案。

04:08.344 --> 04:10.896
- AVEC FROMAGE,
MONSIEUR SQUIDWARD,
- AVEC FROMAGE，
章鱼哥先生，

04:10.896 --> 04:12.275
AVEC FROMAGE.
AVEC FROMAGE。
AVEC FROMAGE。
AVEC FROMAGE。
AVEC FROMAGE。
AVEC FROMAGE。
AVEC FROMAGE。
AVEC FROMAGE。

04:12.275 --> 04:14.551
- MY KRUSTY DOG...
- 我的 Krusty 狗...

04:14.551 --> 04:15.724
HANDWRITTEN ON THE MENU.
手写在菜单上。

04:15.724 --> 04:17.517
OH, PINCH ME, SQUIDWARD.
噢，捏我一下，章鱼哥。

04:17.517 --> 04:19.103
- PINCH YOURSELF, YOU NINNY.
- 掐自己一下，你这个笨蛋。

04:21.655 --> 04:25.206
- SPONGEBOB,
THREE MORE KRUSTY DOGS, PRONTO.
- 海绵宝宝，
马上又来了三只坏脾气的狗。

04:25.206 --> 04:26.448
- AYE-AYE, CAP'’N.
- 是的，CAP''N。

04:26.448 --> 04:27.793
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

04:27.793 --> 04:29.965
THREE MORE ORDERS
OF KRUSTY DOGS,
另外三个订单
坏脾气的狗，

04:29.965 --> 04:31.344
EXTRA KRUSTY.
额外的脆皮。

04:31.344 --> 04:32.827
- WOW, MR. KRABS,
- 哇，先生。螃蟹，

04:32.827 --> 04:35.379
WE SURE ARE GETTING A LOT
OF ORDERS FOR KRUSTY DOGS.
我们肯定会收获很多
Krusty Dogs 的订单。

04:35.379 --> 04:36.379
- YEP.
- 是的。

04:36.379 --> 04:37.827
- YEAH, I'’LL GET THOSE GOING
- 是的，我会去处理这些

04:37.827 --> 04:39.758
RIGHT AFTER I FINISH COOKING UP
THESE KRABBY PATTIES.
煮完饭后
这些蟹肉饼。

04:39.758 --> 04:41.862
- OH, FORGET ABOUT
MAKING THOSE PATTIES,
- 哦，忘了吧
制作那些馅饼，

04:41.862 --> 04:43.931
JUST MAKE THE WIENERS.
做维也纳香肠吧。

04:43.931 --> 04:46.586
- "JUST MAKE THE WIENERS"?
- “只做维也纳香肠”？

04:46.586 --> 04:49.172
UM, EXCUSE ME, MR. KRABS.
嗯，对不起，先生。螃蟹。

04:49.172 --> 04:51.137
WHERE ARE YOU GOING
WITH THAT LADDER?
你要去哪里
有那个梯子吗？

04:51.137 --> 04:52.448
MR. KRABS?
先生。螃蟹？

04:52.448 --> 04:54.034
- I'’M JUST GOING TO
MAKE A FEW CHANGES
- 我只是要去
做一些改变

04:54.034 --> 04:56.137
TO THE KRUSTY KRAB MENU,
THAT'’S ALL.
来到蟹堡王菜单，
仅此而已。

04:56.137 --> 04:57.137
- CHANGES?
- 变化？

04:57.137 --> 04:58.310
- OH, THAT REMINDS ME.
- 哦，这让我想起了。

04:58.310 --> 05:00.103
DO YOU HAVE AN ERASER
I COULD BORROW?
你有橡皮擦吗
我可以借吗？

05:00.103 --> 05:01.931
- ERASER?
- 橡皮擦？

05:01.931 --> 05:03.896
- AH, NEVER MIND,
I'’LL JUST CROSS IT OFF.
- 啊，没关系，
我就把它划掉吧。

05:03.896 --> 05:08.103
NO MORE KRABBY PATTIES.
不再有蟹肉饼。

05:08.103 --> 05:11.137
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:11.137 --> 05:14.103
- [babbling incoherently]
- [语无伦次地胡言乱语]

05:16.379 --> 05:17.379
[sirens blaring]
[警笛鸣响]

05:17.379 --> 05:18.379
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

05:18.379 --> 05:20.827
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

05:20.827 --> 05:22.965
- OKAY, JUST BREATHE
NORMALLY, SON.
- 好吧，呼吸一下
通常情况下，儿子。

05:22.965 --> 05:25.172
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

05:25.172 --> 05:26.689
- THERE YOU GO.
- 好了。

05:26.689 --> 05:28.103
THAT'’S IT.
就是这样。

05:28.103 --> 05:30.137
- THERE.
HE'’S STARTING TO REVIVE.
- 那里。
他开始苏醒了。

05:30.137 --> 05:32.620
- I HAD THIS HORRIBLE DREAM
THAT MR. KRABS
- 我做了一个可怕的梦
那个先生。蟹蟹

05:32.620 --> 05:35.310
WAS NEVER GONNA LET ME COOK
KRABBY PATTIES AGAIN.
从来不让我做饭
又是蟹肉饼。

05:35.310 --> 05:38.206
[heavy scraping sound]
[重重的刮擦声]

05:41.620 --> 05:42.620
- PARDON ME.
- 请原谅我。

05:44.344 --> 05:45.793
[crying]
[哭泣]

05:45.793 --> 05:47.103
- WE'’RE LOSING HIM.
- 我们正在失去他。

05:48.241 --> 05:49.758
crash!
碰撞！

05:51.344 --> 05:53.551
- SPONGEBOB.
- 海绵宝宝。

05:53.551 --> 05:56.068
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

05:56.068 --> 05:58.000
WAKE UP.
醒来吧。

05:59.241 --> 06:01.379
- WHERE AM I?
- 我在哪里？

06:01.379 --> 06:03.379
AND WHAT ARE THESE
PARAMEDICS DOING HERE?
这些是什么
护理人员在这里做什么？

06:03.379 --> 06:06.000
- YOU'’RE BACK
IN YOUR OLD KITCHEN,
- 你回来了
在你的旧厨房里，

06:06.000 --> 06:09.241
AND THE PAIR OF PARAMEDICS
WERE HERE TO REVIVE YOU.
和一对护理人员
来这里让您恢复活力。

06:09.241 --> 06:10.344
- I WAS ASLEEP?
- 我睡着了？

06:10.344 --> 06:11.344
- YEAH.
- 是的。

06:11.344 --> 06:12.965
BUT JUST FOR A LITTLE WHILE.
但只是一小会儿。

06:12.965 --> 06:15.103
SO I ONLY DOCKED YOUR PAY FOR
THE TIME YOU WERE UNCONSCIOUS.
所以我只扣了你的工资
你失去意识的那段时间。

06:17.655 --> 06:20.344
- MR. KRABS, ISN'’T THAT
WHERE THE GRILL USED TO BE?
- 先生。螃蟹，不是吗
烧烤架以前在哪里？

06:20.344 --> 06:21.862
- MAYBE.
- 或许。

06:21.862 --> 06:24.620
BUT NOW WE HAVE THIS!
但现在我们有了这个！

06:27.344 --> 06:30.551
- AND WHAT ABOUT MY--
MY SPATULA?
- 那我的呢--
我的抹刀？

06:30.551 --> 06:32.379
- I GOT YOU A NEW ONE.
- 我给你买了一件新的。

06:36.896 --> 06:37.896
[deflating sound]
[泄气声]

06:37.896 --> 06:40.724
[laughter]
[笑声]

06:40.724 --> 06:43.724
ALL RIGHT, THOSE WIENERS AREN'’T
GONNA ROTISSERIE THEMSELVES.
好吧，那些香肠不是
自己去烤肉店。

06:43.724 --> 06:45.310
EVERYBODY BACK TO WORK.
大家都回去工作了。

06:47.862 --> 06:50.103
- AYE-AYE, CAPTAIN.
- 是的，队长。

06:53.758 --> 06:55.724
SQUIDWARD, CAN I TALK TO YOU
FOR ONE SECOND?
章鱼哥，我能和你谈谈吗
一秒钟？

06:55.724 --> 06:56.758
- I DON'’T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

06:56.758 --> 06:58.103
THAT'’S A PRETTY LONG TALK.
这是一个相当长的谈话。

06:58.103 --> 07:00.241
- HAS ANYTHING EVER HAPPENED
AT YOUR JOB
- 发生过什么事吗
在你的工作岗位上

07:00.241 --> 07:03.827
THAT MADE IT, WELL,
NOT AS FUN AS IT USED TO BE.
这使得它，嗯，
不像以前那么有趣了。

07:03.827 --> 07:05.620
- WELL, ACTUALLY, YES.
- 嗯，实际上，是的。

07:05.620 --> 07:06.724
- REALLY?
WHAT WAS IT.
- 真的吗？
那是什么？

07:06.724 --> 07:07.793
- BEING HIRED.
- 被雇用。

07:07.793 --> 07:09.206
- I DON'’T KNOW WHY,
- 我不知道为什么，

07:09.206 --> 07:10.793
BUT THINGS JUST AREN'’T THE SAME
但事情就是不一样

07:10.793 --> 07:12.931
SINCE KRUSTY DOGS
WERE ADDED TO THE MENU.
自从 Krusty Dogs 以来
已添加到菜单中。

07:12.931 --> 07:14.310
- SPONGEBOB, MY BOY.
- 海绵宝宝，我的孩子。

07:14.310 --> 07:17.275
I REALIZED LONG AGO
THAT THERE IS NOTHING,
我很久以前就意识到
没有什么，

07:17.275 --> 07:22.000
I REPEAT, NOTHING THAT COULD
MAKE THIS JOB ANY MORE BORING
我再说一遍，没有什么可以
让这份工作变得更无聊

07:22.000 --> 07:25.965
OR HUMILIATING OR DEMEANING
THAN IT ALREADY IS.
或侮辱或贬低
现在已经是这样了。

07:29.379 --> 07:32.413
- LOOK AT THAT GUY
DRESSED LIKE A HOT DOG, MOMMY.
- 看看那个家伙
妈妈，穿得像热狗。

07:32.413 --> 07:35.000
- LET THAT INSPIRE YOU
TO STAY IN SCHOOL, BILLY.
- 让这启发您
留在学校，比利。

07:40.344 --> 07:41.344
- MR. KRABS?
- 先生。螃蟹？

07:41.344 --> 07:42.758
- AHOY, SPONGEBOB.
- 嗨，海绵宝宝。

07:42.758 --> 07:44.379
HOW GOES THE WIENERS?
维也纳怎么样了？

07:44.379 --> 07:45.379
- MEH.
- 嗯。

07:45.379 --> 07:46.793
I WAS KIND OF WONDERING,
我有点想知道，

07:46.793 --> 07:49.275
COULD WE JUST GO BACK
TO SELLING KRABBY PATTIES?
我们可以回去吗
卖蟹肉饼？

07:49.275 --> 07:50.965
- WHAT ON EARTH FOR?
- 到底是为了什么？

07:50.965 --> 07:54.689
KRUSTY DOGS
WAS YOUR BEST IDEA EVER, BOY.
坏脾气的狗
这是你有史以来最好的主意，孩子。

07:54.689 --> 07:56.172
- I KNOW, I--
- 我知道，我--

07:56.172 --> 07:58.965
WELL, I GUESS I SORT OF
JUST MISS THE KRABBY PATTIES.
嗯，我想我有点
一定要错过蟹肉饼。

07:58.965 --> 08:01.517
AFTER ALL, THEY'’RE WHAT
GAVE THIS PLACE ITS NAME.
毕竟，它们是什么
给这个地方命名了。

08:01.517 --> 08:03.413
- YEAH, GOOD POINT.
- 是的，好点。

08:03.413 --> 08:06.137
- YEAH, I MEAN, DON'’T YOU THINK
THAT WE SHOULD--
- 是的，我的意思是，你不认为
我们应该——

08:08.103 --> 08:10.206
[gasps]
[喘气]

08:10.206 --> 08:12.448
"KRUSTY DOG"?
“坏狗”？

08:12.448 --> 08:15.310
THOSE WIENERS HAVE GOT TO GO.
那些香肠必须走了。

08:16.620 --> 08:18.310
HERE YOU ARE, HUNGRY CUSTOMERS,
饥饿的顾客们，你们来了，

08:18.310 --> 08:20.034
YOUR DELICIOUS KRUSTY DOGS.
您美味的 Krusty 狗。

08:20.034 --> 08:21.931
- THEY DO LOOK DELICIOUS.
- 它们看起来确实很好吃。

08:21.931 --> 08:23.655
- YES.
- 是的。

08:23.655 --> 08:27.103
EAT ONE AND YOU WILL DEVELOP
AN UNSIGHTLY SKIN CONDITION.
吃一颗，你就会成长
难看的皮肤状况。

08:27.103 --> 08:28.793
HERE'’S YOUR FOOT LONG, SIR.
这是您的脚长，先生。

08:28.793 --> 08:29.862
- THANKS.
- 谢谢。

08:29.862 --> 08:32.137
12 INCHES OF DELICIOUSNESS.
12 英寸的美味。

08:32.137 --> 08:33.482
- YEAH.
- 是的。

08:33.482 --> 08:35.103
YOU KNOW, WHAT GIVES THEM
THAT ADDED FLAVOR?
你知道，是什么给了他们
那增加了味道吗？

08:35.103 --> 08:36.448
- NO, WHAT?
- 不，什么？

08:36.448 --> 08:38.655
- NOSE HAIRS
AND RECYCLED DENTAL FLOSS.
- 鼻毛
和回收牙线。

08:39.931 --> 08:42.000
- SPONGEBOB, WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 海绵宝宝，你在做什么？

08:43.137 --> 08:44.862
- WE HAVE GOT TO GET RID
OF THESE WIENERS
- 我们必须摆脱
这些香肠

08:44.862 --> 08:47.275
AND BRING BACK THE KRABBY PATTY.
把蟹肉饼带回来。

08:47.275 --> 08:50.586
- SPONGEBOB, I NEVER THOUGHT
I'’D BE SAYING THIS,
- 海绵宝宝，我从没想过
我想说的是，

08:50.586 --> 08:52.689
BUT COUNT ME IN.
但算我一个吧。

08:52.689 --> 08:54.137
- HOORAY!
- 万岁！

08:57.034 --> 08:59.172
- HELP!
- 帮助！

08:59.172 --> 09:03.862
I'’M HAVING TERRIBLE
ABDOMINAL PAIN!
我的情况很糟糕
腹部疼痛！

09:03.862 --> 09:06.379
I THINK IT WAS THE...
我认为这是...

09:06.379 --> 09:07.379
THE...
这...

09:07.379 --> 09:08.379
LINE.
线。

09:08.379 --> 09:10.344
- WEINER.
- 韦纳。

09:10.344 --> 09:13.551
- THE WEINER!
- 威纳！

09:13.551 --> 09:14.724
- LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
- 女士们，先生们，

09:14.724 --> 09:16.724
ALLOW ME TO INTRODUCE MYSELF.
请允许我自我介绍一下。

09:16.724 --> 09:19.206
I AM BUT A SIMPLE
OLD-TIMEY GENTLEMAN.
我只是一个简单的人
老绅士。

09:19.206 --> 09:21.896
I CAME HERE
FOR ONE PURPOSE TODAY.
我来到这里
今天只为了一个目的。

09:21.896 --> 09:24.758
- SO I SAID,
"IT DIDN'’T SMELL SO BAD,
- 所以我说，
“闻起来没那么难闻，

09:24.758 --> 09:25.758
"BUT IT TASTE--
“但它尝起来——

09:25.758 --> 09:27.034
- QUIET, GRANNY!
- 安静，奶奶！

09:27.034 --> 09:28.034
I'’M TALKIN'’!
我在说话！

09:28.034 --> 09:29.034
- OH.
- 哦。

09:29.034 --> 09:31.758
- AND THAT IS TO LOUDLY DECRY
- 那就是大声谴责

09:31.758 --> 09:35.068
THESE MODERN NEW-FANGLED DAYS
OF WIENERS
这些现代新奇的日子
维也纳香肠

09:35.068 --> 09:39.310
AND TO BEG FOR A RETURN
TO A SIMPLER TIME,
并乞求回报
到一个更简单的时间，

09:39.310 --> 09:42.103
A KRABBY PATTIER TIME.
蟹肉饼时间。

09:44.344 --> 09:47.689
- I'’M NOT REALLY CONCERNED ABOUT
POSSIBLE ILL HEALTH EFFECTS.
- 我真的不关心
可能的健康不良影响。

09:47.689 --> 09:49.379
HOW ABOUT YOU GUYS?
- NAH.
你们呢？
- 不。

09:49.379 --> 09:50.896
- HOW ABOUT NOSTALGIA?
- 怀旧怎么样？

09:50.896 --> 09:51.965
- NEVER HEARD OF HIM.
- 从没听说过他。

09:53.275 --> 09:54.827
- OKAY, THAT DIDN'’T
WORK AT ALL.
- 好吧，那不是
全力工作。

09:54.827 --> 09:57.862
- IT ONLY SEEMED TO INCREASE
THEIR APPETITE FOR WIENERS.
- 似乎只是增加
他们对维也纳香肠的胃口。

09:57.862 --> 09:59.655
- WE NEED STRONGER TACTICS.
- 我们需要更有力的战术。

09:59.655 --> 10:01.206
- RIGHT.
- 正确的。

10:01.206 --> 10:03.206
SOMETHING THAT WOULD MAKE
MR. KRABS WHOLE WEINER THING
可以做的事情
先生。蟹整威纳东西

10:03.206 --> 10:04.551
BLOW RIGHT UP IN HIS FACE.
直接在他脸上爆炸。

10:04.551 --> 10:05.551
- YEAH.
- 是的。

10:05.551 --> 10:06.827
BLOW UP.
爆破。

10:06.827 --> 10:07.827
honk!
鸣喇叭！

10:07.827 --> 10:08.827
SQUIDWARD, THAT'’S IT!
章鱼哥，就是这样！

10:08.827 --> 10:10.137
[laughs]
[笑]

10:20.275 --> 10:21.344
BEAUTIFUL.
美丽的。

10:23.517 --> 10:25.655
YOUR KRUSTY DOG, SIR,
WITH EXTRA MUSTARD.
您的坏脾气的狗，先生，
加额外的芥末。

10:25.655 --> 10:26.793
- THANKS.
- 谢谢。

10:26.793 --> 10:28.172
- CAN I BRING YOU
SOMETHING ELSE?
- 我可以带你吗
还有别的事吗？

10:30.965 --> 10:32.586
OKAY, I GUESS NOT.
好吧，我想不是。

10:32.586 --> 10:33.896
THANK YOU, SIR.
谢谢您，先生。

10:37.896 --> 10:40.275
WAIT FOR IT, SPONGEBOB,
WAIT FOR IT.
等等，海绵宝宝，
等等。

10:40.275 --> 10:41.551
NOW!
现在！

10:45.172 --> 10:46.172
- YEAH, REMEMBER THAT?
- 是的，还记得吗？

10:46.172 --> 10:47.931
THAT WAS--
OH, MY NEPTUNE!
那是——
哦，我的海王星！

10:47.931 --> 10:50.310
THAT KRUSTY DOG
IS ABOUT TO EXPLODE!
那只坏脾气的狗
即将爆炸！

10:50.310 --> 10:52.275
- WHAT?
WHERE?
- 什么？
在哪里？

10:52.275 --> 10:53.275
pop!
流行音乐！

10:53.275 --> 10:54.689
splat!
啪！

10:54.689 --> 10:57.482
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

10:57.482 --> 10:58.655
[all muttering angrily]
[大家愤怒地嘀咕]

10:58.655 --> 11:00.275
- IT'’S ALL OVER ME.
- 一切都在我身上。

11:00.275 --> 11:01.482
- I-I THINK I'’M GONNA BE SICK.
- 我-我想我要生病了。

11:01.482 --> 11:03.655
- TELL MY GRANDCHILDREN
ABOUT THAT.
- 告诉我的孙子们
关于那个。

11:03.655 --> 11:05.103
- HAVE A NICE DAY.
- 祝你今天过得愉快。

11:05.103 --> 11:07.689
- SPONGEBOB,
WHAT HAPPENED IN HERE?
- 海绵宝宝，
这里发生了什么？

11:07.689 --> 11:09.344
WHERE ARE ALL ME CUSTOMERS?
我所有的客户都在哪里？

11:09.344 --> 11:10.344
WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO?
我们要做什么？

11:10.344 --> 11:12.758
- OOH, I KNOW THE ANSWER.
- 哦，我知道答案。

11:15.103 --> 11:18.103
- HEY, SPONGEBOB,
HAVE YOU SEEN MR. SQUIDWARD?
- 嘿，海绵宝宝，
你见过先生吗？章鱼哥？

11:18.103 --> 11:19.689
- I THINK HE'’S OUTSIDE
ON HIS BREAK.
- 我想他在外面
在他的休息时间。

11:19.689 --> 11:21.068
- PERFECT.
- 完美的。

11:21.068 --> 11:23.724
AND KEEP THEM
KRABBY PATTIES COMING, BOY.
并保留它们
蟹肉饼来了，男孩。

11:23.724 --> 11:25.551
- AYE-AYE, CAPTAIN!
- 是啊，队长！

11:28.517 --> 11:31.517
- MOM, LOOK IT'’S A GUY DRESSED
AS A KRABBY PATTY.
- 妈妈，看这是一个穿衣服的人
作为蟹肉饼。

11:31.517 --> 11:35.000
- IT'’S NEVER TOO SOON TO START
PICKING A GOOD COLLEGE, BILLY.
- 开始永远不会太早
选择一所好大学，比利。

11:38.586 --> 11:40.827
thud!
砰！

11:40.827 --> 11:42.000
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

11:42.000 --> 11:44.586
WELL, I GUESS I WAS WRONG AGAIN.
好吧，我想我又错了。

11:44.586 --> 11:47.137
IT CAN ALWAYS GET
MORE HUMILIATING.
它总是可以得到
更丢脸了。

12:01.448 --> 12:04.379
[laughter]
[笑声]

12:06.068 --> 12:07.068
- YOU'’RE IT!
- 就是你了！

12:07.068 --> 12:08.068
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

12:08.068 --> 12:09.068
- NOT FOR LONG.
- 不会太久。

12:09.068 --> 12:12.000
[laughter]
[笑声]

12:13.103 --> 12:14.551
- HEY, TRY AND CATCH ME,
SPONGEBOB.
- 嘿，试着抓住我，
海绵宝宝。

12:14.551 --> 12:16.655
slam!
猛击！

12:16.655 --> 12:17.965
- TAG, YOU'’RE IT.
- 标签，就是你了。

12:17.965 --> 12:19.206
- OH!
- 哦！

12:19.206 --> 12:20.931
THIS GAME'’S TOO HARD.
这个游戏太难了。

12:20.931 --> 12:22.172
- I KNOW.
- 我知道。

12:22.172 --> 12:24.551
WHAT IF BOTH OF US ARE IT?
如果我们都是这样怎么办？

12:24.551 --> 12:27.620
- BUT, THEN,
WHO'’S GONNA BE NOT IT?
- 但是，那么，
谁不会是这样？

12:27.620 --> 12:29.551
- EXACTLY,
NEITHER OF US WILL KNOW.
- 正是如此，
我们谁都不会知道。

12:29.551 --> 12:31.655
- OH.
- 哦。

12:31.655 --> 12:34.034
I LIKE NOT KNOWING.
我喜欢不知道。

12:34.034 --> 12:35.620
LET'’S PLAY!
让我们玩！

12:35.620 --> 12:36.689
- I'’M IT!
- I'’M IT!
- 我就是它！
- 我就是它！

12:36.689 --> 12:37.758
- I'’M IT!
- I'’M IT!
- 我就是它！
- 我就是它！

12:37.758 --> 12:38.827
- I'’M IT!
- I'’M IT!
- 我就是它！
- 我就是它！

12:38.827 --> 12:39.896
- I'’M IT!
- I'’M IT!
- 我就是它！
- 我就是它！

12:39.896 --> 12:40.931
- I'’M IT!
- I'’M IT!
- 我就是它！
- 我就是它！

12:40.931 --> 12:42.758
- I'’M IT!
- I'’M IT!
- 我就是它！
- 我就是它！

12:42.758 --> 12:43.965
[laughing]
[笑]

12:43.965 --> 12:45.206
WHOA!
哇啊！

12:45.206 --> 12:46.862
[screaming]
[尖叫]

12:46.862 --> 12:47.862
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

12:47.862 --> 12:49.068
smash!
粉碎！

12:49.068 --> 12:50.551
- HANG ON;
I'’M COMING!
- 不挂断;
我来了！

12:50.551 --> 12:52.241
[screams]
[尖叫声]

12:52.241 --> 12:53.482
crash!
碰撞！

12:53.482 --> 12:55.482
[muffled speech]
[低声说话]

12:55.482 --> 12:57.965
- WOW, WHAT IS THIS PLACE?
- 哇，这是什么地方？

12:57.965 --> 13:00.793
- LOOK AT ALL THIS COOL STUFF!
- 看看这些很酷的东西！

13:00.793 --> 13:03.379
[laughs]
[笑]

13:03.379 --> 13:05.241
HA!
哈！

13:05.241 --> 13:08.000
I'’M THE CAPTAIN!
我是队长！

13:08.000 --> 13:10.137
YO-HO-HO, YA MATEYS!
哟-嗬-嗬，你们朋友们！

13:10.137 --> 13:11.172
ARR!
到达！

13:13.793 --> 13:16.413
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

13:16.413 --> 13:18.068
EN GARDE!
花园！

13:20.551 --> 13:21.448
WHOA!
哇啊！

13:24.275 --> 13:25.448
THANKS, SPONGEBOB.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

13:25.448 --> 13:27.275
I GUESS WE BETTER
BE MORE CAREFUL.
我想我们更好
更加小心。

13:27.275 --> 13:28.517
- LET'’S GO BACK
TO THE MAIN DECK.
- 我们回去吧
到主甲板。

13:28.517 --> 13:30.448
- OKAY.
- 好的。

13:30.448 --> 13:32.000
[screams]
thud!
[尖叫声]
砰！

13:32.000 --> 13:33.241
- PATRICK!
- 帕特里克！

13:33.241 --> 13:34.862
I'’M COMING, BUDDY.
我来了，伙计。

13:36.137 --> 13:37.137
PATRICK?
帕特里克？

13:37.137 --> 13:38.448
thunk!
咚！

13:38.448 --> 13:39.724
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

13:39.724 --> 13:43.413
- OOH, SHINY AND SMOOTH.
- 哦，闪亮光滑。

13:46.689 --> 13:47.896
- WOW, WHAT'’S THIS?
- 哇，这是什么？

13:47.896 --> 13:50.275
"MAUNA LOA."
“莫纳罗亚”。

13:50.275 --> 13:51.793
[electronic beeping]
[电子蜂鸣声]

13:51.793 --> 13:52.793
WHOA, I'’M LATE!
哇，我迟到了！

13:52.793 --> 13:54.206
GOT TO GET TO WORK.
得去工作了。

13:56.586 --> 13:57.586
♪ MAUNA LOA ♪
♪ 莫纳罗亚 ♪

13:57.586 --> 13:58.655
♪ HOW I LOVE YA ♪
♪ 我多么爱你 ♪

13:58.655 --> 14:01.206
♪ SECRET LOVIN'’ HIDEAWAY ♪
♪ 秘密爱的隐居处 ♪

14:01.206 --> 14:03.655
♪ MY MAUNA LOA BAY-YAY-BEE ♪
♪ 我的莫纳罗亚湾蜜蜂 ♪

14:03.655 --> 14:05.620
- SPONGEBOB.
- 海绵宝宝。

14:05.620 --> 14:07.103
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

14:07.103 --> 14:08.586
SPONGEBOB, WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
海绵宝宝，你在做什么？

14:08.586 --> 14:10.103
I'’VE BEEN SAYING
I NEED A KRABBY PATTY
我一直在说
我需要一份蟹肉饼

14:10.103 --> 14:12.448
ABOUT A BAJILLION TIMES,
AND YOU--
大约无数次，
还有你——

14:12.448 --> 14:13.931
WHAT THE?
什么？

14:13.931 --> 14:15.965
[laughs]
[笑]

14:15.965 --> 14:18.137
NICE PATTY, MICHELANGELO.
漂亮的帕蒂，米开朗基罗。

14:18.137 --> 14:20.689
I HOPE YOU'’RE NOT EXPECTING
AN AWARD ANY TIME SOON.
我希望你没有期待
很快就会获奖。

14:20.689 --> 14:22.517
[laughs]
[笑]

14:22.517 --> 14:23.793
- OH, THAT'’S JUST MY SECRET--
- 哦，这只是我的秘密--

14:23.793 --> 14:24.896
OH!
哦！

14:24.896 --> 14:28.000
[laughs nervously]
[紧张地笑]

14:28.000 --> 14:29.896
HERE YOU GO.
干得好。

14:29.896 --> 14:31.586
- POROUS FREAK.
- 多孔怪物。

14:31.586 --> 14:32.655
- WHEW!
- 哇！

14:32.655 --> 14:33.655
THAT WAS CLOSE.
已经很接近了。

14:33.655 --> 14:34.931
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

14:34.931 --> 14:37.655
CHECK OUT THE NEW T-SHIRT
I JUST MADE.
查看新款 T 恤
我刚做的。

14:37.655 --> 14:39.206
♪ SECRET HIDEOUT ♪
♪ 秘密藏身处 ♪

14:39.206 --> 14:40.586
♪ SECRET HIDEOUT ♪
♪ 秘密藏身处 ♪

14:40.586 --> 14:42.275
♪ SECRET HIDEOUT ♪
♪ 秘密藏身处 ♪

14:42.275 --> 14:43.586
♪ SECRET HIDEOUT ♪
♪ 秘密藏身处 ♪

14:43.586 --> 14:45.068
♪ SECRET HIDEOUT ♪
♪ 秘密藏身处 ♪

14:45.068 --> 14:46.241
♪ SECRET HIDE-- ♪
♪ 秘密隐藏—— ♪

14:46.241 --> 14:47.620
- PATRICK, PLEASE!
- 帕特里克，请！

14:47.620 --> 14:49.068
WHAT ARE YOU TRYING TO DO,
你想做什么，

14:49.068 --> 14:51.758
GIVE AWAY OUR SECRET HIDEOUT?
泄露我们的秘密藏身处？

14:51.758 --> 14:53.241
GIVE ME THAT.
给我那个。

14:53.241 --> 14:55.344
- WHAT'’S WITH ALL THE RACKET?
- 所有球拍都有什么？

14:55.344 --> 14:57.000
- UH, S-SORRY, SIR.
- 呃，对不起，先生。

14:57.000 --> 14:59.379
- PATRICK, IF YOU'’RE GONNA
DISTRACT ME FRY COOK,
- 帕特里克，如果你愿意的话
DISTRACT ME FRY COOK,

14:59.379 --> 15:01.275
THE LEAST YOU COULD DO
IS BUY SOME GRUB.
至少你能做的
是买一些GRUB。

15:01.275 --> 15:03.344
- YOU GOT IT, MR. KRABS.
- 你明白了，先生。螃蟹。

15:03.344 --> 15:04.344
- BACK TO WORK, BOY.
- 回去工作吧，男孩。

15:04.344 --> 15:06.758
- SURE THING.
- 当然可以。

15:06.758 --> 15:09.689
[bell chimes]
[钟声]

15:10.758 --> 15:12.310
AR!
增强现实！

15:12.310 --> 15:13.965
- OH, LOOKS LIKE
THE WORK DAY IS OVER.
- 哦，看起来像
工作日结束了。

15:13.965 --> 15:15.724
SEE YOU TOMORROW, SIR.
明天见，先生。

15:15.724 --> 15:16.689
- THAT'’S...
- 那是...

15:16.689 --> 15:17.758
ODD.
奇怪的。

15:17.758 --> 15:19.034
- HMM.
- 唔。

15:19.034 --> 15:20.310
WELL, LET'’S SEE.
好吧，让我们看看。

15:20.310 --> 15:21.551
- COME ON, PATRICK.
- 来吧，帕特里克。

15:21.551 --> 15:22.965
WE HAVE TO GET BACK TO OUR...
我们必须回到我们的...

15:22.965 --> 15:24.310
PLAYGROUND.
操场。

15:24.310 --> 15:27.551
- KEEP THE CHANGE, MY GOOD MAN.
- 保持改变，我的好人。

15:27.551 --> 15:28.689
- HMM.
- 唔。

15:28.689 --> 15:29.965
A GUM WRAPPER
口香糖包装纸

15:29.965 --> 15:31.655
AND A COIN
THAT SAYS "MAUNA LOA."
和一枚硬币
上面写着“莫纳罗亚”。

15:31.655 --> 15:33.275
- MAUNA LOA?
- 莫纳罗亚？

15:33.275 --> 15:35.517
AS IN THE SHIPWRECK MAUNA LOA?
就像莫纳罗亚海难一样？

15:35.517 --> 15:36.965
LEGEND HAS IT
传说有它

15:36.965 --> 15:40.137
THAT THE LARGEST UNFOUND
PIRATE'’S BOOTY LIES...
最大的未发现的
海盗的战利品谎言......

15:40.137 --> 15:41.655
IN ITS RUINS.
在它的废墟中。

15:41.655 --> 15:43.758
- I'’VE BEEN SEARCHING
FOR THIS TREASURE
- 我一直在寻找
为了这个宝藏

15:43.758 --> 15:45.758
NEARLY ME ENTIRE ADULT LIFE,
几乎我整个成年生活，

15:45.758 --> 15:48.206
LOOKING OVER EVERY NOOK,
EVERY CRANNY,
审视每一个角落，
每一个缝隙，

15:48.206 --> 15:49.827
EVERY DUMPSTER.
每个垃圾箱。

15:49.827 --> 15:51.758
ONCE I GET ME CLAWS ON IT,
一旦我抓住它，

15:51.758 --> 15:54.655
I'’LL BE THE RICHEST CRUSTACEAN
IN THE WORLD.
我将成为最富有的甲壳类动物
在世界上。

15:54.655 --> 15:56.896
- WELL, I GUESS
THAT EXPLAINS THIS.
- 嗯，我猜
这就解释了这一点。

15:56.896 --> 15:58.103
- HMM.
- 唔。

15:58.103 --> 15:59.655
LOOKS LIKE HIM
AND PATRICK ARE TRYING
看起来像他
帕特里克正在尝试

15:59.655 --> 16:01.689
TO HORDE THE LOT FOR THEMSELVES.
为自己占领土地。

16:01.689 --> 16:03.103
- COME ON, SQUIDWARD.
- 来吧，章鱼哥。

16:03.103 --> 16:05.172
WE'’RE GONNA LET THOSE
TWO DINGALINGS
我们会让那些
两个丁加林

16:05.172 --> 16:07.862
LEAD US STRAIGHT
TO THE MAUNA LOA.
引导我们直行
前往莫纳罗亚山。

16:07.862 --> 16:10.586
- ACTUALLY, I HAVE A HOT DATE
WITH MY TOENAIL CLIPPER TONIGHT.
- 事实上，我有一个热门约会
今晚用我的脚趾甲刀。

16:10.586 --> 16:11.655
BUT HAVE FUN WITH THAT.
但请享受其中的乐趣。

16:14.103 --> 16:17.241
- HEY, PATRICK, DO YOU THINK
WE GAVE AWAY TOO MUCH
- 嘿，帕特里克，你认为
我们放弃了太多

16:17.241 --> 16:18.862
ABOUT OUR SECRET HIDEOUT?
关于我们的秘密藏身处？

16:18.862 --> 16:20.551
- OH, GEE, SPONGEBOB.
- 哦，天哪，海绵宝宝。

16:20.551 --> 16:23.724
WHO CARES IF EVERYONE KNOWS
ABOUT OUR SECRET HIDEOUT?
谁在乎是否每个人都知道
关于我们的秘密藏身处？

16:23.724 --> 16:25.344
- DOESN'’T THAT MAKE
THE SECRET HIDEOUT
- 这不是吗
秘密藏身处

16:25.344 --> 16:26.965
A LITTLE LESS SECRET-Y?
不那么秘密吗？

16:26.965 --> 16:28.448
- WELL, NO.
- 嗯，不。

16:28.448 --> 16:32.758
IT'’S JUST A SECRET
THAT EVERYBODY KNOWS ABOUT.
这只是一个秘密
每个人都知道。

16:32.758 --> 16:33.758
[leaves rustling]
[树叶沙沙作响]

16:33.758 --> 16:36.620
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

16:36.620 --> 16:37.620
WHAT'’S WRONG, SPONGEBOB?
怎么了，海绵宝宝？

16:37.620 --> 16:39.068
- JUST AS I THOUGHT.
- 正如我所想的。

16:39.068 --> 16:40.551
WE'’RE BEING FOLLOWED.
我们被跟踪了。

16:40.551 --> 16:41.620
THAT'’S IT.
就是这样。

16:44.724 --> 16:46.344
LOOKS LIKE NO ONE
WAS FOLLOWING US
看起来没人
正在跟踪我们

16:46.344 --> 16:47.793
TO THE HIDEOUT AFTER ALL.
毕竟到了藏身处。

16:47.793 --> 16:49.172
- FOUND IT!
- 找到了！

16:49.172 --> 16:50.448
- HEY.
- 嘿。

16:50.448 --> 16:52.137
WERE YOU FOLLOWING US?
你在关注我们吗？

16:52.137 --> 16:54.000
- NO, I JUST SAW THE SIGN.
- 不，我刚刚看到了标志。

16:55.551 --> 16:56.689
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

16:58.275 --> 17:00.551
- SO YOU THOUGHT
YOU COULD HIDE THE TREASURE
- 你是这么想的
你可以隐藏宝藏

17:00.551 --> 17:02.862
FROM OLD MAN KRABS, DID YOU?
来自蟹老头，是吗？

17:02.862 --> 17:04.620
- I'’M NOT AWARE OF ANY TREASURE,
- 我不知道有任何宝藏，

17:04.620 --> 17:06.689
BUT I SUPPOSE SINCE
YOU'’RE SUCH A NICE BOSS,
但我想从那时起
你真是个好老板，

17:06.689 --> 17:08.103
YOU CAN HANG OUT AT THE HIDEOUT,
你可以在藏身处闲逛，

17:08.103 --> 17:09.689
JUST AS LONG AS YOU KEEP IT
A SECRET.
只要您保留它
一个秘密。

17:09.689 --> 17:11.517
[mimicking SpongeBob]
[模仿海绵宝宝]

17:11.517 --> 17:12.689
YOU'’RE SUCH A NICE--
你真好——

17:12.689 --> 17:15.137
YOU EXPECT ME TO BELIEVE
THIS MALARKEY?
你希望我相信
这个胡言乱语？

17:15.137 --> 17:17.103
THE OLD STONEWALL, EH?
老石墙，嗯？

17:17.103 --> 17:19.000
WELL, WE'’LL SEE ABOUT THAT.
好吧，我们会看到这一点。

17:20.482 --> 17:22.655
WHERE'’D YOU TWO BLUNDERERS
FIND THE GOLD COIN?
你们两个犯了什么大错
找到金币了吗？

17:22.655 --> 17:24.793
- IF MY EYES WEREN'’T BURNING
LIKE THEY WERE FULL OF LAVA,
- 如果我的眼睛没有灼伤
就像充满熔岩一样，

17:24.793 --> 17:26.862
I COULD SHOW YOU.
我可以给你看。

17:26.862 --> 17:29.068
- PUSHOVERS.
- 推倒。

17:29.068 --> 17:30.379
[laughing]
[笑]

17:30.379 --> 17:33.413
- I KNEW I'’D FIND IT!
- 我知道我会找到它！

17:33.413 --> 17:35.241
CHECK IT OUT, FELLERS!
检查一下，伙计们！

17:35.241 --> 17:38.413
COLD, HARD DOUBLOONS!
又冷又硬的达布隆！

17:38.413 --> 17:41.103
- UH, YOU MIGHT WANT TO TAKE
A CLOSER LOOK AT YOUR COINAGE.
- 呃，你可能想要接受
仔细看看您的硬币。

17:42.206 --> 17:43.482
- EH?
WHAT'’S THIS?
-呃？
这是什么？

17:43.482 --> 17:45.827
"TOKEN HAS NO MONETARY VALUE"?
“代币没有货币价值”？

17:45.827 --> 17:47.034
TOKENS?
代币？

17:47.034 --> 17:48.586
THIS MUST BE A DECOY.
这一定是一个诱饵。

17:53.793 --> 17:55.310
- AHOY, MR. KRABS.
- 嗨，先生。螃蟹。

17:55.310 --> 17:57.586
MAYBE THEY HID THE LOOT OFF-SHIP
IN THAT SHED.
也许他们把战利品藏在了船外
在那个棚子里。

18:00.034 --> 18:01.793
- HEE-HEE!
- 嘻嘻！

18:01.793 --> 18:03.793
WHAT THE BARNACLES?
什么是藤壶？

18:03.793 --> 18:06.551
IT'’S JUST FULL OF TICKETS.
里面全是门票。

18:06.551 --> 18:09.137
- WELL, YOU USUALLY DO FIND
TICKETS IN A TICKET BOOTH.
- 嗯，你通常会发现
在售票亭购买门票。

18:09.137 --> 18:10.620
- TICKET BOOTH?
- 售票亭？

18:10.620 --> 18:12.655
- AND WHY ARE THERE HEIGHT
RESTRICTIONS ON THE CREW?
- 为什么有高度
对船员的限制？

18:12.655 --> 18:14.965
- "MUST BE THIS TALL TO RIDE"?
- “必须这么高才能骑”？

18:14.965 --> 18:17.793
- WELL, MAYBE THEY HAD SOMETHING
AGAINST SHORT PEOPLE.
- 嗯，也许他们有一些东西
反对矮个子。

18:17.793 --> 18:19.482
I LIKE THEIR LITTLE CLOTHES.
我喜欢他们的小衣服。

18:20.689 --> 18:23.068
- "CAPTAIN'’S QUARTERS."
- “船长的住处。”

18:23.068 --> 18:25.551
THERE MUST BE SOME
TREASURE HERE, MR. KRABS.
一定有一些
宝藏在这里，先生。螃蟹。

18:25.551 --> 18:27.000
- OUT OF ME WAY, BOY.
- 别挡我的路，孩子。

18:29.275 --> 18:30.379
I KNEW IT.
我就知道。

18:30.379 --> 18:32.000
THE LOST TREASURE
OF THE MAUNA LOA
失落的宝藏
莫纳罗亚山

18:32.000 --> 18:33.655
IS FINALLY MINE.
终于是我的了。

18:33.655 --> 18:36.551
I CAN PRACTICALLY
TASTE THEM JEWELS.
我实际上可以
品尝珠宝。

18:38.517 --> 18:40.862
THAT WAS A LITTLE LIGHTER
THAN I THOUGHT.
那是有点轻
比我想象的要多。

18:40.862 --> 18:41.862
HUH?
嗯？

18:41.862 --> 18:43.310
IT'’S EMPTY.
它是空的。

18:43.310 --> 18:44.482
NO GOOD!
不好！

18:44.482 --> 18:45.517
HA HA!
哈哈！

18:45.517 --> 18:46.793
VERY CLEVER, CAP'’N.
非常聪明，船长。

18:46.793 --> 18:49.241
THROWING KRABS
THE OL'’ RINGER, EH?
扔螃蟹
老林格，呃？

18:49.241 --> 18:51.344
HE MUST HAVE A TREASURE MAP
OR SOMETHING.
他一定有一张藏宝图
或者什么。

18:51.344 --> 18:52.620
WHERE YOU KEEPING IT?
你把它放在哪里？

18:52.620 --> 18:53.655
IN YOUR POCKET?
在你的口袋里吗？

18:56.896 --> 18:58.103
PLASTIC?
塑料？

18:58.103 --> 18:59.310
HANG ON A MINUTE.
请稍等。

18:59.310 --> 19:03.241
PLASTIC CAPTAIN,
A TICKET BOOTH, TOKENS.
塑料船长，
售票亭，代币。

19:03.241 --> 19:05.206
THIS AIN'’T THE WRECK
OF THE MAUNA LOA.
这不是残骸
莫纳罗亚山。

19:05.206 --> 19:08.206
IT'’S THE WRECK OF THE MAUNA LOA
AMUSEMENT PARK RIDE.
这是莫纳罗亚火山的残骸
游乐园游乐设施。

19:08.206 --> 19:09.206
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

19:09.206 --> 19:11.793
- NO WONDER WE WERE SO AMUSED.
- 难怪我们这么开心。

19:11.793 --> 19:14.379
- WELL, I'’M NOT.
- 嗯，我不是。

19:14.379 --> 19:16.068
- REMEMBER, YOU'’RE ALWAYS
WELCOME BACK
- 记住，你永远都是
欢迎回来

19:16.068 --> 19:17.344
AT THE SECRET HIDEOUT.
在秘密藏身处。

19:17.344 --> 19:18.965
- THIS PLACE AIN'’T GOT
NO TREASURE.
- 这个地方没有
没有宝藏。

19:18.965 --> 19:20.758
KEEP YOUR WORTHLESS
HUNK OF JUNK.
让你一文不值
一大堆垃圾。

19:20.758 --> 19:22.482
- OKAY, BUT WOULD YOU MIND
- 好吧，但是你介意吗

19:22.482 --> 19:24.724
KEEPING THIS WORTHLESS
HUNK OF JUNK A SECRET?
保持这个毫无价值
一大堆垃圾是秘密？

19:24.724 --> 19:25.965
WOULDN'’T BE MUCH OF A SECRET
没什么秘密

19:25.965 --> 19:27.931
IF WE HAD
A MILLION PEOPLE SHOWING UP.
如果我们有
百万人现身。

19:27.931 --> 19:30.551
- HO, HO, HO,
DON'’T FLATTER YOURSELF.
- 嗬，嗬，嗬，
不要自吹自擂。

19:30.551 --> 19:32.206
PEOPLE WANT TO SEE
THE REAL THING.
人们想看
真实的东西。

19:32.206 --> 19:34.758
IT'’S NOT LIKE A MILLION PEOPLE
JUST SHOW UP
这不像一百万人
只要出现

19:34.758 --> 19:37.758
TO AN OLD AMUSEMENT PARK RIDE
FOR FUN.
前往古老的游乐园
为了好玩。

19:37.758 --> 19:39.206
WAIT A MINUTE.
等一下。

19:39.206 --> 19:40.344
THAT'’S EXACTLY WHAT THEY DO.
这正是他们所做的。

19:40.344 --> 19:41.931
HO, HO, HO!
嗬，嗬，嗬！

19:41.931 --> 19:43.724
BRACE YOURSELVES, FELLERS.
振作起来，伙计们。

19:43.724 --> 19:45.551
YOUR HIDEAWAY IS ABOUT TO BECOME
您的世外桃源即将成为

19:45.551 --> 19:48.137
THE WORST-KEPT SECRET
IN THE SEA.
最保守的秘密
在海里。

19:48.137 --> 19:50.620
- WELCOME TO THE WRECK
OF THE MAUNA LOA.
- 欢迎来到沉船
莫纳罗亚山。

19:50.620 --> 19:51.620
ARR.
到达。

19:51.620 --> 19:52.655
HOW MAY I HELP YOU?
我能为您提供什么帮助？

19:52.655 --> 19:54.689
- I'’LL TAKE TEN TOKENS, PLEASE.
- 请给我十枚代币。

19:54.689 --> 19:55.689
- STEP RIGHT UP.
- 站起来。

19:55.689 --> 19:56.965
DON'’T BE SHY.
不要害羞。

19:56.965 --> 19:59.310
EXPERIENCE THE AMUSEMENT
AND TERROR
体验乐趣
和恐怖

19:59.310 --> 20:01.896
OF THE WRECK OF THE MAUNA LOA.
莫纳罗亚火山的残骸。

20:01.896 --> 20:04.827
[crowd hollering]
[人群呼喊]

20:07.655 --> 20:12.551
all: WHOA! WHOA! WHOA!
WHOA! WHOA!
所有人：哇！哇啊！哇啊！
哇啊！哇啊！

20:12.551 --> 20:13.551
- THAT'’S RIGHT, FOLKS,
- 没错，各位，

20:13.551 --> 20:15.000
WE SPARED NO EXPENSE
我们不惜一切代价

20:15.000 --> 20:18.275
IN RESTORING THIS CLASSIC SHIP
TO ITS FORMER GLORY.
修复这艘经典船舶
为了它以前的荣耀。

20:18.275 --> 20:20.275
- SORRY, HONEY,
BUT YOU'’LL HAVE TO COME BACK
- 对不起，亲爱的，
但你必须回来

20:20.275 --> 20:21.275
WHEN YOU'’RE A BIG BOY.
当你是个大男孩时。

20:21.275 --> 20:24.172
- OH, I DISAGREE.
- 哦，我不同意。

20:24.172 --> 20:29.137
I'’D SAY THE LITTLE FELLER'’S
JUST RIGHT.
我想说的是小家伙的
恰到好处。

20:29.137 --> 20:30.620
[laughs]
[笑]

20:30.620 --> 20:32.931
[all muttering indistinctly]
[大家都含糊不清地嘀咕着]

20:32.931 --> 20:34.689
- IT'’S GONE, PATRICK.
- 不见了，帕特里克。

20:34.689 --> 20:38.620
OUR SECRET PARADISE
IS GONE FOREVER.
我们的秘密天堂
永远消失了。

20:38.620 --> 20:43.000
- AND, ALAS, EVEN
THE JOYOUS SHRIEKS OF CHILDREN
- 而且，唉，甚至
孩子们欢乐的尖叫声

20:43.000 --> 20:45.758
CANNOT LIFT MY SUNKEN HEART.
无法抬起我沉沦的心。

20:45.758 --> 20:47.551
- HOW ABOUT ANOTHER RIDE
TO CHEER YOU UP?
- 再来一次怎么样
让你高兴起来？

20:47.551 --> 20:48.655
- LET'’S DO THIS!
- 让我们开始吧！

20:48.655 --> 20:51.586
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

20:53.620 --> 20:55.241
- WHOO-HOO-HOO!
- 呼呼呼！

20:55.241 --> 20:57.068
clang!
铛！

20:57.068 --> 20:58.517
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

20:59.758 --> 21:02.724
[machine powering up]
[机器通电]

21:03.793 --> 21:06.068
[crowd screaming]
[人群尖叫]

21:06.068 --> 21:07.931
[laughter]
[笑声]

21:10.517 --> 21:12.827
- WHOA!
- 哇！

21:12.827 --> 21:14.758
- [laughing]
- [笑]

21:19.758 --> 21:20.689
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

21:23.689 --> 21:25.931
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

21:25.931 --> 21:29.689
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

21:29.689 --> 21:30.724
- WHOA!
- 哇！

21:30.724 --> 21:33.206
boom!
繁荣！

21:36.931 --> 21:38.551
both: WHOO!
两人：哇！

21:38.551 --> 21:41.379
WHOO! WHOO! WHOO!
哇！哇！哇！

21:41.379 --> 21:43.000
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

21:43.000 --> 21:44.793
- THAT WAS AWESOME!
- 太棒了！

21:44.793 --> 21:45.793
- YEAH!
- 是的！

21:45.793 --> 21:47.379
TOTALLY REALISTIC.
完全现实。

21:47.379 --> 21:48.655
- REALISTIC?
- 实际的？

21:48.655 --> 21:51.344
THAT REALISM
NEARLY COST US OUR LIVES.
那种现实主义
差点让我们丧命。

21:51.344 --> 21:53.448
- MR. KRABS PUT
ALL OUR LIVES IN DANGER
- 先生。螃蟹看跌期权
我们所有人的生命都处于危险之中

21:53.448 --> 21:55.206
WITH THIS CARELESS CONTRAPTION.
有了这个粗心的装置。

21:55.206 --> 21:56.655
- WHAT WERE YOU THINKING?
- 你在想什么？

21:56.655 --> 21:58.137
OUR LITTLE BOY
COULD'’VE BEEN HURT
我们的小男孩
可能会受伤

21:58.137 --> 21:59.862
ON YOUR DISASTER OF A RIDE.
关于您的骑行灾难。

21:59.862 --> 22:03.551
- OKAY, PEOPLE, LET'’S NOT
DO ANYTHING WE MIGHT REGRET.
- 好吧，大家，别这样
做任何我们可能会后悔的事情。

22:03.551 --> 22:05.827
- TOO LATE FOR THAT, KRABS.
- 太晚了，蟹蟹。

22:05.827 --> 22:07.000
- WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?
- 你在说什么？

22:07.000 --> 22:08.862
YOU CAN'’T TAKE ME TO THE POKEY.
你不能带我去那个小地方。

22:08.862 --> 22:11.896
- FOR OPERATING A DANGER
TO PUBLIC SAFETY I CAN,
- 用于操作危险
为了公共安全我可以，

22:11.896 --> 22:13.310
AND I WILL.
我会的。

22:13.310 --> 22:15.482
HONESTLY, I THINK
YOU'’LL BE SAFER IN PRISON.
老实说，我认为
你在监狱里会更安全。

22:20.551 --> 22:23.620
- WELL, BUDDY, I GUESS WE
REALLY LOST OUR SECRET HIDEOUT
- 好吧，伙计，我想我们
真的失去了我们的秘密藏身处

22:23.620 --> 22:24.793
THIS TIME.
这次。

22:24.793 --> 22:26.793
- AND JUST WHEN EVERYONE
WAS STARTING
- 当每个人都
正在开始

22:26.793 --> 22:28.724
TO FIND OUT ABOUT IT, TOO.
也来了解一下。

22:28.724 --> 22:30.310
- OH, WHO KNOWS, PATRICK?
- 哦，谁知道呢，帕特里克？

22:30.310 --> 22:33.793
THE NEXT FUN, FUN PLACE MIGHT BE
JUST AROUND THE CORNER, HUH?
下一个有趣、有趣的地方可能是
就在拐角处，嗯？

22:33.793 --> 22:35.413
- WELL, I DOUBT IT.
- 嗯，我对此表示怀疑。

22:36.586 --> 22:37.724
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

22:37.724 --> 22:38.896
slam!
猛击！

22:40.655 --> 22:42.793
"THE REAL MAUNA LOA"?
“真正的莫纳罗亚”？

22:42.793 --> 22:44.344
OOH.
哦。

22:44.344 --> 22:46.965
PATRICK, CAN YOU KEEP A SECRET?
帕特里克，你能保守秘密吗？

22:46.965 --> 22:47.896
- NOPE.
- 没有。

22:50.724 --> 22:53.689
